{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878450/extras/Great_Risks_Great_achievements.png?t=1745870968\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878450/extras/TopBar.png?t=1745870968\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Overview</h2>Take command during Europe's greatest 18th-century conflict, leading a custom-tailored army from one of five distinctive factions\u2014Prussia, France, Britain, Austria, or Russia. Navigate procedurally generated campaigns, each offering unpredictable challenges that require constant adaptation. With only one chance to succeed, the destruction of your army means game over. Pay close attention to logistics, carefully plan your routes, and employ superior tactics in intense real-time battles. Your survival hinges on every decision, making this a high-stakes, strategic experience where loss in battle is not an option.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878450/extras/Logo.gif?t=1745870968\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878450/extras/Divider.png?t=1745870968\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878450/extras/Great_Leaders_Great_History.png?t=1745870968\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Campaign</h2>&quot;Master of Command&quot; features: <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Layered campaign system</li><li>Dynamically generated regional map around Prussia</li><li>Recruit troops</li><li>Upgrade Troops</li><li>Upgrade Officers</li><li>Upgrade your General</li><li>Supply your army</li><li>Gain rewards through battles and events</li></ul> Here, players select a region to campaign in, each offering enemies from across Europe, equipment, and terrain, ensuring varied strategic encounters with every playthrough. Upon choosing a region to campaign in, you're thrust into a second, randomly generated map of that area. Here, the challenge intensifies - recruit troops, engage in skirmishes, and bolster your forces to dominate the territory. As regions are conquered, the difficulty escalates, culminating in a final, desperate defense against a coalition's assault on your home region. This dual-layered approach combines strategic oversight with tactical depth, ensuring every campaign is a test of your military acumen.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878450/extras/Territories.gif?t=1745870968\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878450/extras/Divider.png?t=1745870968\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Battles</h2>Battle mechanics demand real-time tactical prowess. Manage your troops' morale, ammunition, and combat effectiveness to outmaneuver your foes. The game's stylized yet realistic battle system emphasizes strategic planning, with commanding officers playing pivotal roles in inspiring your troops to victory.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878450/extras/Gameplay.gif?t=1745870968\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878450/extras/Divider.png?t=1745870968\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878450/extras/Great_Soldiers_Great_Victories.png?t=1745870968\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customization</h2>&quot;Master of Command&quot; offers extensive customization to foster a deep connection with your army. Equip regiments with diverse weaponry, personalize flags, and modify uniforms for a truly powerful military force. Upgrade and reform units to preserve their legacy and enhance their capabilities. With each victory, your troops gain veterancy and officers gain abilities based on how you want to control your army on and off the battlefield. This customization extends to strategic choices, affecting your army's performance and survivability on the battlefield.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878450/extras/BottomBar.png?t=1745870968\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2878450?t=1745870968","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878450/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745870968","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878450/3b00406eb069c2810e85d7ce336be66a3c7c0942/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745870968","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878450/3b00406eb069c2810e85d7ce336be66a3c7c0942/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745870968","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878450/extras/Great_Risks_Great_achievements.png?t=1745870968\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878450/extras/TopBar.png?t=1745870968\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Overview</h2>Take command during Europe's greatest 18th-century conflict, leading a custom-tailored army from one of five distinctive factions\u2014Prussia, France, Britain, Austria, or Russia. Navigate procedurally generated campaigns, each offering unpredictable challenges that require constant adaptation. With only one chance to succeed, the destruction of your army means game over. Pay close attention to logistics, carefully plan your routes, and employ superior tactics in intense real-time battles. Your survival hinges on every decision, making this a high-stakes, strategic experience where loss in battle is not an option.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878450/extras/Logo.gif?t=1745870968\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878450/extras/Divider.png?t=1745870968\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878450/extras/Great_Leaders_Great_History.png?t=1745870968\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Campaign</h2>&quot;Master of Command&quot; features: <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Layered campaign system</li><li>Dynamically generated regional map around Prussia</li><li>Recruit troops</li><li>Upgrade Troops</li><li>Upgrade Officers</li><li>Upgrade your General</li><li>Supply your army</li><li>Gain rewards through battles and events</li></ul> Here, players select a region to campaign in, each offering enemies from across Europe, equipment, and terrain, ensuring varied strategic encounters with every playthrough. Upon choosing a region to campaign in, you're thrust into a second, randomly generated map of that area. Here, the challenge intensifies - recruit troops, engage in skirmishes, and bolster your forces to dominate the territory. As regions are conquered, the difficulty escalates, culminating in a final, desperate defense against a coalition's assault on your home region. This dual-layered approach combines strategic oversight with tactical depth, ensuring every campaign is a test of your military acumen.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878450/extras/Territories.gif?t=1745870968\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878450/extras/Divider.png?t=1745870968\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Battles</h2>Battle mechanics demand real-time tactical prowess. Manage your troops' morale, ammunition, and combat effectiveness to outmaneuver your foes. The game's stylized yet realistic battle system emphasizes strategic planning, with commanding officers playing pivotal roles in inspiring your troops to victory.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878450/extras/Gameplay.gif?t=1745870968\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878450/extras/Divider.png?t=1745870968\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878450/extras/Great_Soldiers_Great_Victories.png?t=1745870968\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customization</h2>&quot;Master of Command&quot; offers extensive customization to foster a deep connection with your army. Equip regiments with diverse weaponry, personalize flags, and modify uniforms for a truly powerful military force. Upgrade and reform units to preserve their legacy and enhance their capabilities. With each victory, your troops gain veterancy and officers gain abilities based on how you want to control your army on and off the battlefield. This customization extends to strategic choices, affecting your army's performance and survivability on the battlefield.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878450/extras/BottomBar.png?t=1745870968\" />","developers":["Armchair History Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878450/header.jpg?t=1745870968","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257015608,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257015608/movie480.mp4?t=1713107027","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257015608/movie_max.mp4?t=1713107027"},"name":"Revea